WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 13]

02:05.380 --> 02:07.100
His crime is unforgivable!

02:07.180 --> 02:08.260
Last night, he burned down

02:08.540 --> 02:10.380
the Wei Village and killed 46 people!

02:11.220 --> 02:12.700
Today, we will

02:12.940 --> 02:15.420
beat him to death in public

02:15.580 --> 02:18.060
to atone for his sins.

02:19.380 --> 02:20.140
Sorry.

02:21.260 --> 02:22.340
Because of me,

02:23.580 --> 02:24.980
you were also scolded by the elders.

02:25.620 --> 02:26.580
Don't be silly.

02:27.020 --> 02:27.900
As your brother,

02:27.940 --> 02:29.060
I must protect you.

02:29.420 --> 02:30.940
Sadly, this is too serious.

02:31.220 --> 02:32.500
Our elders are furious.

02:33.500 --> 02:34.620
Even as the head of our clan,

02:35.340 --> 02:36.660
I can't get you out of it.

02:40.020 --> 02:40.580
Yanlai,

02:42.140 --> 02:43.700
I believe you're innocent.

02:46.700 --> 02:47.540
Once I'm away,

02:49.580 --> 02:50.100
those elders

02:50.140 --> 02:51.300
won't come after you anymore.

02:51.620 --> 02:52.620
Where are you going?

02:54.260 --> 02:55.340
Any plans?

02:58.780 --> 02:59.940
This is a big world.

03:03.540 --> 03:05.100
I will always have somewhere to go.

03:06.460 --> 03:07.820
This secret elixir only belongs

03:07.860 --> 03:08.940
to our direct line.

03:10.260 --> 03:11.820
It can even revive the dying.

03:12.820 --> 03:13.980
Keep it with you

03:14.500 --> 03:15.900
in case of emergency.

03:36.020 --> 03:36.940
Sorry, sir.

03:37.100 --> 03:37.860
We're closed today.

03:38.060 --> 03:38.500
Closed.

03:38.580 --> 03:39.260
Sorry.

03:39.260 --> 03:40.180
Sorry for that.

03:40.180 --> 03:40.820
We're closed. Sorry.

03:41.100 --> 03:41.660
Mr. Deng,

03:42.060 --> 03:43.980
the venison and roast pork of Fenglin Restaurant

03:44.260 --> 03:45.340
are absolutely delicious.

03:46.060 --> 03:47.300
And have some meat soup.

03:47.460 --> 03:48.780
That would be even better.

03:49.060 --> 03:49.860
How about...?

03:51.900 --> 03:52.980
I just need noodles.

03:56.140 --> 03:57.500
When the Yang and Zhao Clans

03:57.540 --> 03:59.300
held great power as imperial in-laws,

03:59.900 --> 04:00.820
a single meal of theirs

04:01.100 --> 04:02.620
would feed an ordinary family

04:02.740 --> 04:04.060
for an entire year.

04:04.700 --> 04:05.900
This gives a glimpse of the extravagance

04:06.220 --> 04:07.500
of the imperial in-laws in power.

04:07.620 --> 04:08.220
Mr. Deng,

04:08.660 --> 04:11.500
we must bring down the Xie Clan.

04:11.700 --> 04:12.220
Yes.

04:12.540 --> 04:13.700
Yes, exactly.

04:13.980 --> 04:16.940
We can't let them rise like the Yang and Zhao Clans.

04:17.980 --> 04:19.260
I wish they would rise

04:19.300 --> 04:20.460
like the Yang and Zhao Clans.

04:20.740 --> 04:22.220
The rebellion of the Third Prince,

04:22.700 --> 04:24.060
the young emperor,

04:24.100 --> 04:25.220
and the foreign invasion...

04:25.700 --> 04:26.580
The root cause

04:27.220 --> 04:29.220
was the trouble of imperial in-laws.

04:29.620 --> 04:30.660
Now, common folks

04:31.220 --> 04:32.900
hate them a lot.

04:33.940 --> 04:35.300
Once the Xie Clan oversteps,

04:35.780 --> 04:37.500
even their reputation over a century

04:37.980 --> 04:39.340
won't make anyone forgive them.

04:41.620 --> 04:42.820
It makes sense, Mr. Deng.

04:42.980 --> 04:44.300
It makes sense.

04:46.140 --> 04:48.340
Xie Yanfang is cunning

04:48.580 --> 04:49.820
and sophisticated.

04:50.060 --> 04:51.980
He excels at seeking good fame.

04:52.420 --> 04:54.020
Now, he's the Emperor's uncle.

04:54.300 --> 04:56.740
Many people entrust him

04:56.900 --> 04:57.940
with state affairs.

04:58.260 --> 04:59.260
His reputation has grown.

04:59.820 --> 05:01.220
But the Xie Clan

05:01.580 --> 05:03.100
has more than just Xie Yanfang.

05:03.620 --> 05:04.500
Leaving others aside,

05:04.820 --> 05:06.620
his brother Xie Yanlai

05:07.820 --> 05:10.100
behaves quite arrogantly

05:10.180 --> 05:11.740
just like the Yang and Zhao Clans.

05:12.620 --> 05:13.900
Well, Xie Yanlai

05:14.060 --> 05:15.220
is quite extraordinary.

05:15.940 --> 05:17.580
He can even manipulate His Majesty.

05:17.940 --> 05:20.100
I would rather say

05:21.180 --> 05:23.460
someone else manipulates His Majesty.

05:24.940 --> 05:26.460
The Grand Princess does not

05:26.500 --> 05:27.540
trust Xie Yanfang.

05:27.820 --> 05:29.180
But she shows Xie Yanlai

05:29.820 --> 05:31.260
special favor.

05:31.740 --> 05:33.140
And why is that?

05:34.180 --> 05:35.180
Maybe

05:37.380 --> 05:38.380
she wants to raise up

05:38.380 --> 05:39.620
a new imperial uncle

05:40.020 --> 05:41.340
to cause infighting.

05:42.940 --> 05:44.460
When brothers turn against each other,

05:44.620 --> 05:46.420
a fight for status would be the worst.

05:46.940 --> 05:47.780
Xie Yanlai is favored

05:47.860 --> 05:49.620
and supported by the Grand Princess.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.860
If he fights for power,

05:52.260 --> 05:53.780
Xie Yanfang will surely

05:54.020 --> 05:55.100
have a headache.

06:00.060 --> 06:00.660
Father.

06:02.300 --> 06:02.940
Father.

06:04.740 --> 06:06.180
Our spy's latest report says

06:06.820 --> 06:07.940
Chu Ling has been unconscious for days.

06:08.740 --> 06:09.860
He's probably dying.

06:11.500 --> 06:12.420
Xun,

06:13.300 --> 06:15.500
look at the alchemy fire behind me.

06:16.380 --> 06:17.700
Spiritual elixirs can only be done

06:18.180 --> 06:19.380
by slow simmering.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.940
An intense fire

06:21.020 --> 06:22.340
will end in vain.

06:22.700 --> 06:23.620
Your rash alliance

06:23.780 --> 06:25.140
with the Northern Desert at Wangcheng

06:25.180 --> 06:26.100
utterly failed.

06:26.580 --> 06:27.620
Do you realize your fault?

06:28.220 --> 06:28.940
Father,

06:29.500 --> 06:30.500
I had a perfect plan

06:30.980 --> 06:32.220
for the battle of Wangcheng.

06:32.940 --> 06:34.380
But Chu Zhao interfered...

06:36.100 --> 06:37.140
Once something goes wrong,

06:37.260 --> 06:38.580
your plan cannot be branded as perfect.

06:43.780 --> 06:44.500
Father,

06:45.740 --> 06:46.580
fortunately,

06:47.300 --> 06:48.940
I eliminated their remnants.

06:49.660 --> 06:50.900
No future threats will be left.

06:51.500 --> 06:52.300
Don't worry, Father.

06:59.700 --> 07:01.860
How many times have I told you?

07:02.980 --> 07:04.140
To seek great things,

07:04.300 --> 07:05.860
you must behave like the stove fire.

07:06.780 --> 07:08.060
You should stay patient

07:08.300 --> 07:09.820
until the right moment comes.

07:10.220 --> 07:11.620
I don't quite agree.

07:13.340 --> 07:15.140
The war between the two states

07:15.140 --> 07:16.180
has been going on for days,

07:16.700 --> 07:18.340
but it's not intense.

07:18.620 --> 07:19.860
Victory reports in the Capital

07:20.460 --> 07:21.380
make people feel

07:21.700 --> 07:22.540
that the Northern Desert

07:22.540 --> 07:23.780
is merely bluffing.

07:24.260 --> 07:25.340
Actually, that's not true.

07:25.820 --> 07:27.220
The Northern Desert Royal Army

07:27.820 --> 07:28.660
has been waiting

07:29.060 --> 07:29.860
for a chance

07:29.860 --> 07:31.180
to strike a fatal blow.

07:32.660 --> 07:33.460
The chance is

07:33.820 --> 07:34.860
the death of Chu Ling.

07:35.540 --> 07:37.100
You're being too impatient.

07:37.700 --> 07:39.500
Northern Desert foes are treacherous.

07:39.540 --> 07:41.100
They aren't a reliable ally.

07:41.220 --> 07:42.060
Father,

07:42.500 --> 07:43.300
let me lead troops

07:43.300 --> 07:44.380
to Yunzhong.

07:45.940 --> 07:46.940
The Royal Army

07:47.420 --> 07:48.580
has gathered and departed.

07:48.940 --> 07:49.860
They're determined

07:50.180 --> 07:51.060
to win this battle.

07:51.580 --> 07:52.220
Chu Ling

07:52.540 --> 07:53.540
is on his last legs.

07:54.260 --> 07:55.260
He won't live long.

07:56.300 --> 07:56.940
It's time for us

07:56.980 --> 07:58.260
to turn the tide.

07:59.260 --> 08:00.540
Even if Chu Ling dies,

08:02.380 --> 08:04.660
his army can still fight a war.

08:05.380 --> 08:06.540
What you should do

08:07.380 --> 08:08.660
is to lead troops to the Capital

08:11.060 --> 08:11.780
and guard the Emperor.

08:17.340 --> 08:18.100
Yes.

08:37.620 --> 08:38.420
Go get Mr. Zhong.

08:38.660 --> 08:39.100
Yes.

08:46.940 --> 08:47.460
Zhao,

08:47.700 --> 08:48.500
scouts reported

08:48.860 --> 08:50.220
the Northern Desert Royal Army

08:50.420 --> 08:51.940
passed Heishui Ridge

08:52.180 --> 08:53.780
and is less than a hundred li away.

08:53.780 --> 08:55.380
Beacon towers along the way were ruined.

08:55.780 --> 08:57.620
I'm afraid they'll arrive very soon.

08:57.860 --> 09:00.060
We must make early plans.

09:00.980 --> 09:02.140
Looks like their king knows

09:02.180 --> 09:04.060
about Father's condition.

09:06.740 --> 09:08.180
He knows the time has come.

09:08.540 --> 09:10.620
The General's condition has been kept secret.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.100
I don't know why...

09:12.380 --> 09:14.180
Nothing stays hidden forever.

09:16.060 --> 09:17.860
Now, there's no need

09:19.140 --> 09:20.100
to hunt for spies.

09:28.620 --> 09:29.500
Since their king

09:29.580 --> 09:31.100
has led the troops himself,

09:32.860 --> 09:34.380
I will command our troops

09:35.900 --> 09:37.060
to fight them

09:38.740 --> 09:40.340
on behalf of my father.

09:41.420 --> 09:43.180
The commander's absence from the war

09:44.740 --> 09:46.580
will surely affect the army's morale.

09:49.020 --> 09:50.300
If a woman like me

09:51.260 --> 09:53.100
took command in her father's place,

09:54.740 --> 09:56.380
the result wouldn't be as good.

09:58.340 --> 09:59.180
But luckily,

10:00.140 --> 10:00.900
I'm not only

10:00.900 --> 10:02.460
Chu Ling's daughter,

10:03.580 --> 10:05.660
but also the Grand Princess of State.

10:07.020 --> 10:09.100
Heed my order, Zhong Changrong.

10:09.580 --> 10:10.260
Yes.

10:11.020 --> 10:12.580
Prepare the Grand Princess's procession.

10:15.740 --> 10:16.980
We'll set out for war.

10:23.820 --> 10:25.700
The secrets of Xie Clan of Gaoyang

10:26.340 --> 10:27.660
are indeed more spectacular

10:27.660 --> 10:28.820
than I imagined.

10:29.540 --> 10:30.940
All who surrender,

10:31.180 --> 10:32.180
for any reason,

10:32.980 --> 10:35.060
shall be executed immediately

10:35.220 --> 10:36.860
and excluded from the ancestral graves.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.060
The Xie's secret elixir

10:39.580 --> 10:41.300
can bring the dead back to life.

10:42.260 --> 10:43.620
It's kept by the clan head.

10:44.260 --> 10:45.980
Only the direct line can see it.

10:48.620 --> 10:50.500
Bring the dead back to life?

10:53.340 --> 10:54.540
How interesting.

10:57.380 --> 10:59.020
Knowing that my father is gravely ill,

10:59.340 --> 11:00.900
Four hundred thousand Northern Desert troops came up,

11:01.180 --> 11:02.380
trying to capture Yunzhong.

11:09.060 --> 11:09.700
Mr. Zhong,

11:10.140 --> 11:10.940
you lead main troops

11:11.140 --> 11:12.580
to confront the enemy's main force.

11:13.460 --> 11:14.100
Yes.

11:15.740 --> 11:16.700
I'll go with Zhong.

11:16.820 --> 11:17.340
No.

11:17.900 --> 11:20.180
You take the Vanguard Battalion to charge out from the left wing,

11:20.700 --> 11:21.780
go through Yingzui Valley,

11:22.060 --> 11:23.860
and circle around to the enemy's rear.

11:24.580 --> 11:26.340
You and Mr. Zhong launch a pincer attack

11:26.540 --> 11:28.220
to break up the enemy's assault.

11:28.540 --> 11:29.140
Yes.

11:29.900 --> 11:31.100
If you fail this mission,

11:31.300 --> 11:32.260
you'll be punished.

11:33.380 --> 11:34.660
Yingzui Valley is vital.

11:34.700 --> 11:35.940
Our enemies also know that.

11:36.260 --> 11:37.700
They'll guard it with massive forces.

11:37.820 --> 11:38.620
I take your order.

11:42.060 --> 11:43.780
I pledge to take Yingzui Valley.

11:44.700 --> 11:45.660
Move out now.

11:46.020 --> 11:46.700
- Yes. - Yes.

11:46.780 --> 11:49.060
We swear to live and die for Yunzhong.

11:50.020 --> 11:50.820
In this battle,

11:51.540 --> 11:53.180
I will make our enemies know

11:53.780 --> 11:55.060
that we will never yield a single inch

11:55.420 --> 11:56.540
of our own territory.

12:44.140 --> 12:46.980
When our state is in turmoil,

12:47.660 --> 12:48.900
our late Emperor is gone,

12:49.460 --> 12:50.980
and our new emperor is still young,

12:51.780 --> 12:52.820
the Northern Desert invades our frontier

12:53.300 --> 12:54.460
and slaughters our people.

12:55.060 --> 12:56.740
As the Grand Princess of State,

12:57.580 --> 12:59.620
I must protect all the people.

13:00.180 --> 13:01.100
In the name

13:01.860 --> 13:03.620
of the Grand Princess of State,

13:03.740 --> 13:04.900
I condemn the Northern Desert.

13:05.180 --> 13:06.420
Those who invade our land...

13:07.100 --> 13:07.820
Kill them!

13:08.140 --> 13:09.500
Those who butcher our people...

13:10.100 --> 13:10.860
Kill them!

13:11.420 --> 13:12.660
Soldiers,

13:13.300 --> 13:15.020
follow me in killing the enemies!

13:16.340 --> 13:17.820
We'll defend our territory

13:19.020 --> 13:20.500
and guard our people!

13:20.740 --> 13:25.460
- Kill! - Kill!

13:25.820 --> 13:29.940
- Kill! - Kill!

13:30.220 --> 13:34.020
- Kill! - Kill!

13:34.500 --> 13:35.140
Let's kill!

13:39.860 --> 13:40.740
Charge!

13:46.820 --> 13:48.740
Charge!

13:53.540 --> 13:56.660
[Yingzui Valley]

14:14.780 --> 14:15.660
How dare

14:16.420 --> 14:17.900
those northern foes invade our land!

14:18.020 --> 14:18.620
Don't die.

14:18.860 --> 14:19.580
You either.

15:12.860 --> 15:13.500
At this rate,

15:13.700 --> 15:14.420
we can't hold on.

15:14.700 --> 15:16.060
Without reinforcements, we'll lose.

15:16.180 --> 15:17.060
Hold on, all of you!

15:17.620 --> 15:19.140
Frontier soldiers like us would rather

15:19.220 --> 15:20.380
die on the battlefield!

15:36.220 --> 15:37.580
The Grand Princess of State.

15:38.220 --> 15:40.700
Anyone who kills the Grand Princess

15:40.980 --> 15:41.940
will win a title.

15:41.980 --> 15:44.220
Kill!

15:58.460 --> 15:59.260
Why are you here?

15:59.340 --> 16:00.700
To do what a mother should do.

16:01.500 --> 16:02.860
You've suffered heavy casualties.

16:03.220 --> 16:04.420
Unless you break through here,

16:04.820 --> 16:05.740
even the reinforcements

16:05.740 --> 16:07.140
will be trapped and killed at this pass.

16:07.580 --> 16:09.220
It's Alan Ruoying.

16:09.780 --> 16:11.940
The traitor our king has been hunting for 19 years.

16:12.300 --> 16:13.860
How come she's here?

16:14.180 --> 16:15.380
Catch Alan Ruoying alive!

16:25.020 --> 16:25.660
I still failed

16:26.860 --> 16:28.100
to be the perfect mother

16:28.180 --> 16:29.500
in your heart.

16:31.860 --> 16:32.780
I'm sorry.

16:34.420 --> 16:35.780
I can find a way to break through.

16:35.980 --> 16:37.260
Don't do anything stupid!

16:37.260 --> 16:38.020
That day,

16:38.300 --> 16:39.540
you said you would grant me a reward.

16:40.780 --> 16:41.540
Now, I'm asking

16:41.580 --> 16:42.580
for this reward.

16:48.260 --> 16:49.340
I want you to live.

16:51.500 --> 16:52.300
You want to know

16:52.300 --> 16:53.820
how I've been all these years.

16:54.500 --> 16:55.500
You also want to know

16:55.620 --> 16:56.980
if I have forgiven you.

16:58.340 --> 16:59.420
If you die,

17:00.380 --> 17:01.140
you will never

17:01.140 --> 17:02.420
know the answers.

17:09.500 --> 17:10.660
Actually, I know.

17:14.180 --> 17:15.220
I've always known.

17:15.980 --> 17:16.820
No!

17:17.580 --> 17:18.540
Mother!

17:19.580 --> 17:20.700
Don't go!

17:21.420 --> 17:23.060
Don't leave me alone!

17:28.660 --> 17:29.820
Mother!

17:47.220 --> 17:49.180
Mother!

19:15.300 --> 19:16.020
General.

19:16.300 --> 19:17.180
It's the General.

19:17.740 --> 19:19.260
He's beating the drum to cheer us on!

19:21.860 --> 19:25.700
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

19:26.300 --> 19:28.980
♪I'm my own pawn♪

19:29.420 --> 19:31.940
♪I sigh at my fate♪

19:32.020 --> 19:34.900
Kill!

19:36.260 --> 19:37.220
My mother

19:39.060 --> 19:40.780
asked me to live.

19:41.500 --> 19:42.620
Soldiers, on my command!

19:43.860 --> 19:44.820
Kill!

19:45.220 --> 19:46.500
Kill!

19:47.100 --> 19:51.420
♪An old dream fades♪

19:52.780 --> 19:58.140
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

19:58.780 --> 20:01.140
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

20:01.420 --> 20:03.860
♪I take a risk at every step♪

20:03.860 --> 20:04.980
Listen to the battle cries.

20:07.340 --> 20:09.060
Her Highness is as good as you, General.

20:09.500 --> 20:11.580
She's fighting alongside Jiu to kill the enemies.

20:13.100 --> 20:16.020
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

20:16.380 --> 20:18.980
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

20:21.980 --> 20:22.900
Zhao,

20:24.580 --> 20:27.060
you must stay alive.

20:27.220 --> 20:29.540
♪We're born like a mere ant♪

20:29.860 --> 20:33.540
♪Joy and sorrow go unheard♪

20:34.220 --> 20:40.420
♪I follow my destined path♪

20:41.100 --> 20:45.780
♪All the sand is washed away♪

20:47.180 --> 20:52.020
♪An old dream fades♪

20:53.300 --> 20:58.660
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

20:59.060 --> 21:01.900
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

21:02.060 --> 21:05.300
♪I take a risk at every step♪

21:05.420 --> 21:08.300
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

21:08.660 --> 21:14.780
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

21:16.380 --> 21:18.900
♪The play begins♪

21:18.900 --> 21:19.660
General...

21:21.100 --> 21:23.180
General!

21:32.420 --> 21:33.820
Father.

21:33.900 --> 21:34.540
We...

21:54.260 --> 21:55.420
- General. - General.

22:45.860 --> 22:46.580
Father.

22:49.380 --> 22:50.740
We won.

23:01.980 --> 23:02.860
The General

23:04.460 --> 23:05.820
died on the battlefield

23:06.660 --> 23:08.220
the way he wished.

23:16.940 --> 23:17.580
Zhao.

23:25.060 --> 23:26.020
All of you, leave us.

23:27.700 --> 23:28.500
- Yes. - Yes.

23:56.820 --> 23:58.300
Mu Mianhong blasted open

24:00.700 --> 24:02.900
the pass at Yingzui Valley for us.

24:14.660 --> 24:16.100
Father didn't lie to me.

24:19.580 --> 24:20.980
My mother

24:22.740 --> 24:25.060
is the best woman in the world.

24:26.900 --> 24:27.940
She's kind

24:29.740 --> 24:30.660
and brave.

24:32.500 --> 24:33.940
And she loves me.

24:36.700 --> 24:37.540
Mr. Zhong,

24:40.300 --> 24:41.180
my mother...

24:43.460 --> 24:44.700
She loves me.

24:46.020 --> 24:48.420
She protected me with her own life.

24:49.660 --> 24:50.380
Zhao,

24:50.700 --> 24:52.220
if you feel sad,

24:52.660 --> 24:54.020
let it all out.

24:54.820 --> 24:55.740
Sad?

24:56.860 --> 24:57.860
I'm not sad.

25:01.980 --> 25:03.300
My father watched us

25:03.340 --> 25:04.500
defeat our enemies.

25:05.940 --> 25:06.780
And now,

25:07.940 --> 25:09.180
he and my mother

25:10.020 --> 25:11.740
can be reunited in the underworld.

25:13.100 --> 25:13.980
They no longer need

25:13.980 --> 25:15.540
to worry about mortal affairs.

25:17.740 --> 25:19.060
I feel happy for them.

25:42.900 --> 25:43.740
Make an announcement.

25:44.500 --> 25:45.820
Guard General Chu Ling

25:49.300 --> 25:49.940
passed away.

25:51.900 --> 25:52.660
Now?

25:53.340 --> 25:54.140
Is it appropriate?

25:54.700 --> 25:56.620
The Northern Desert King lost and fled.

25:56.940 --> 25:58.580
But the war isn't over yet.

25:59.060 --> 26:01.140
If we announce the General's death now,

26:01.980 --> 26:03.700
will our soldiers lose heart?

26:04.020 --> 26:04.980
Now is the time.

26:07.020 --> 26:08.180
We should let them know

26:09.740 --> 26:11.300
the General has fought with them

26:11.340 --> 26:12.380
and died in battle.

26:14.860 --> 26:15.900
A general like him...

26:16.700 --> 26:17.900
Even when he's gone,

26:19.820 --> 26:20.900
the soldiers will believe

26:20.980 --> 26:22.140
he's still there for them.

26:23.220 --> 26:25.340
Even if the enemies return at once,

26:26.420 --> 26:28.020
they will be fearless.

26:30.460 --> 26:31.620
My father used

26:31.620 --> 26:32.780
the last of his strength

26:33.420 --> 26:34.660
to repel the enemies.

26:36.700 --> 26:38.300
When we announce his death now,

26:39.420 --> 26:41.100
grief shall turn into strength

26:42.220 --> 26:43.460
instead of panic.

26:46.100 --> 26:47.380
We're fearless.

26:48.380 --> 26:49.940
We're invincible.

26:55.180 --> 26:56.100
Our state

26:57.060 --> 26:58.060
will win!

27:09.860 --> 27:13.540
- Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell! - Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

27:14.300 --> 27:17.860
- Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell! - Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

27:18.780 --> 27:22.780
- Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell! - Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

27:29.900 --> 27:33.220
- Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell! - Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

27:33.300 --> 27:36.700
- Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell! - Guard General Chu Ling! Farewell!

28:26.740 --> 28:27.500
You haven't slept for three days.

28:28.380 --> 28:29.460
Are you torturing yourself?

28:39.740 --> 28:40.540
I'm sorry.

28:42.140 --> 28:43.020
Satisfied, huh?

28:51.100 --> 28:52.380
Why must you push me?

28:52.820 --> 28:53.380
Must you see

28:53.420 --> 28:54.820
how I break down?

28:55.180 --> 28:55.900
Xie Yanlai,

28:56.540 --> 28:57.540
does it make you happy

28:57.540 --> 28:58.380
when you crush

28:58.620 --> 28:59.820
my composure?

29:05.500 --> 29:06.300
Do you know why

29:06.300 --> 29:07.140
I can't close my eyes?

29:08.380 --> 29:09.500
Because when I close my eyes,

29:10.420 --> 29:11.180
I see how my mother

29:11.220 --> 29:12.380
sacrificed her life before me.

29:14.540 --> 29:15.780
And I see

29:16.700 --> 29:17.740
how my father passed away

29:17.740 --> 29:18.820
with his eyes still open.

29:20.300 --> 29:21.660
How am I supposed to face this?

29:22.860 --> 29:24.740
How can I not hate or feel pain?

29:25.140 --> 29:25.820
It's your fault.

29:25.980 --> 29:26.900
He could have lived.

29:26.940 --> 29:27.980
Even if he remained feeble,

29:27.980 --> 29:29.220
he could at least be alive!

29:29.740 --> 29:30.900
If he lived,

29:31.220 --> 29:32.220
I wouldn't be an orphan.

29:32.540 --> 29:34.020
You're the murderer.

29:34.700 --> 29:35.980
My mother died before me.

29:36.660 --> 29:37.820
And you killed my father.

29:37.860 --> 29:38.700
It's you!

30:06.340 --> 30:06.940
Zhao.

30:26.260 --> 30:26.820
Mr. Deng,

30:27.260 --> 30:28.820
we looked into the Xie's secret elixir.

30:33.900 --> 30:34.980
It's the Bloodburn Pill.

30:35.540 --> 30:36.700
It's peculiarly poisonous.

30:37.100 --> 30:39.420
Its power to revive the dead is a fraud.

30:39.780 --> 30:40.660
Every time it is used,

30:41.140 --> 30:42.420
death comes closer.

30:43.540 --> 30:45.100
The bloodburn energy

30:46.340 --> 30:47.500
has a supernatural effect,

30:48.340 --> 30:49.740
so it takes a supernatural cost.

30:50.820 --> 30:52.380
Everything in this world

30:52.980 --> 30:54.700
has been destined.

31:02.180 --> 31:03.180
Three years ago,

31:03.900 --> 31:05.660
Chu Ling was badly injured in a battle.

31:05.980 --> 31:06.980
He healed quickly

31:07.020 --> 31:08.540
and won battles in the next year

31:08.620 --> 31:09.540
as if he were blessed.

31:10.100 --> 31:11.540
Yet his body kept getting worse.

31:11.660 --> 31:13.220
He coughed up blood and went blind.

31:13.700 --> 31:14.460
No one around him

31:14.460 --> 31:15.700
except Xie Yanlai

31:16.180 --> 31:17.940
was able to do that.

31:18.780 --> 31:20.340
This can't possibly be a coincidence.

31:20.780 --> 31:22.260
Are you saying

31:23.140 --> 31:23.900
the Xie Family

31:24.700 --> 31:25.820
poisoned Chu Ling?

31:26.620 --> 31:28.340
I wonder how the Grand Princess

31:28.820 --> 31:30.780
will feel when she knows

31:31.220 --> 31:32.740
her most trusted Xie Yanlai

31:33.780 --> 31:35.180
poisoned her father.

31:36.820 --> 31:38.260
Announcement from the frontier!

31:38.340 --> 31:40.060
Guard General Chu Ling passed away!

31:40.380 --> 31:41.900
Announcement from the frontier!

31:42.140 --> 31:43.740
Guard General Chu Ling passed away!

31:44.300 --> 31:45.780
Announcement from the frontier!

31:45.980 --> 31:47.180
Guard General Chu Ling passed away!

31:47.260 --> 31:47.980
Shao You.

31:49.340 --> 31:50.140
Guess.

31:52.060 --> 31:52.900
Can we use

31:52.980 --> 31:54.540
the death of the God of War

31:55.420 --> 31:56.380
to uproot the Xie Clan

31:56.380 --> 31:57.940
from their century-old power?

31:59.380 --> 32:00.740
Go spread the news.

32:01.700 --> 32:03.220
Make sure everyone knows it.

32:04.780 --> 32:05.380
Yes.

32:11.100 --> 32:11.980
His Lordship is right.

32:12.260 --> 32:13.180
Chu Ling is gone,

32:13.980 --> 32:15.220
but it's still hard

32:15.380 --> 32:16.220
to invade Yunzhong.

32:16.980 --> 32:18.220
Luckily, you took his advice

32:18.540 --> 32:19.500
not to act rashly.

32:20.940 --> 32:22.820
Once again, they ruined

32:23.420 --> 32:24.540
such a great chance.

32:24.820 --> 32:25.740
Calm down.

32:26.220 --> 32:27.340
We'll find another chance.

32:30.620 --> 32:31.660
Chu Ling is dead.

32:32.780 --> 32:33.820
Under such circumstances,

32:35.060 --> 32:36.500
Xie Yanlai is most likely

32:36.540 --> 32:37.500
to take over his troops.

32:38.300 --> 32:39.380
Xie Yanlai

32:40.140 --> 32:41.060
ruined your plan

32:41.060 --> 32:42.100
at Cangmu Stronghold

32:42.300 --> 32:43.300
and then helped Chu Zhao

32:43.300 --> 32:44.340
defeat the enemies.

32:44.900 --> 32:46.140
If he takes command,

32:46.900 --> 32:48.140
he'll be a huge threat.

32:53.820 --> 32:54.780
Tie Ying.

32:57.420 --> 32:58.180
Think about it.

32:58.900 --> 33:00.140
Rumors that Chu Ling

33:00.140 --> 33:02.020
was killed by the Xie's secret elixir

33:02.940 --> 33:04.340
have spread to the Capital.

33:06.260 --> 33:07.860
Chu Ling enjoyed immense prestige

33:07.940 --> 33:09.140
in Yunzhong.

33:09.980 --> 33:10.900
Those frontier troops.

33:12.180 --> 33:13.620
Those common people

33:13.740 --> 33:14.860
under his protection.

33:17.580 --> 33:18.460
Tell me.

33:19.740 --> 33:21.460
Do you think Xie Yanlai, the murderer,

33:23.980 --> 33:25.860
can leave Yunzhong alive?

33:26.420 --> 33:27.340
In my opinion,

33:27.940 --> 33:28.460
he can't.

33:29.020 --> 33:30.020
Frontier folks are loyal.

33:30.460 --> 33:31.340
If they believe

33:31.860 --> 33:33.220
Xie Yanlai poisoned General Chu...

33:35.060 --> 33:35.780
Good.

33:36.940 --> 33:37.940
Very good.

33:39.500 --> 33:41.900
Since rumors have reached the Capital,

33:43.540 --> 33:45.700
we'll add fuel to the fire.

33:46.420 --> 33:47.500
Spread the news to Yunzhong

33:48.180 --> 33:49.460
as quickly as possible.

33:51.060 --> 33:52.500
I can't wait to see

33:53.580 --> 33:54.740
how he gets crushed

33:54.740 --> 33:56.500
by angry people

33:57.460 --> 33:58.900
and perishes in misery.

34:00.460 --> 34:01.740
There are rumors

34:02.500 --> 34:04.860
that General Chu Ling was killed by the Xie's secret elixir,

34:05.180 --> 34:06.700
the Bloodburn Pill.

34:07.500 --> 34:08.580
These mere rumors

34:08.860 --> 34:10.060
have spread far and wide.

34:11.340 --> 34:12.060
Mr. Xie,

34:12.900 --> 34:13.820
what's your opinion?

34:14.180 --> 34:16.260
Mr. Deng, I'm not

34:16.660 --> 34:18.180
as well-informed as you.

34:19.380 --> 34:21.220
I didn't hear those rumors until today.

34:21.660 --> 34:23.260
Then, ministers,

34:23.900 --> 34:25.140
what do you think

34:25.380 --> 34:26.940
when one single clan

34:27.660 --> 34:28.900
has such poison?

34:29.940 --> 34:31.820
General Chu Ling died.

34:32.220 --> 34:33.740
Who knows if one of us

34:33.780 --> 34:36.060
will be poisoned next?

34:38.380 --> 34:39.660
Mr. Deng has a point.

34:40.500 --> 34:41.580
If someone evil

34:41.660 --> 34:43.340
uses such poison,

34:43.540 --> 34:44.980
the consequences would be terrible.

34:45.180 --> 34:46.940
It makes sense, Censor.

34:48.540 --> 34:49.540
But lately,

34:49.540 --> 34:51.220
I've heard about something fun.

34:52.100 --> 34:54.100
Mr. Deng is keeping

34:55.420 --> 34:57.340
the late Emperor's relics.

34:58.140 --> 34:59.100
Mr. Deng,

34:59.900 --> 35:01.020
what do you have to say?

35:02.700 --> 35:03.580
Mr. Xie,

35:04.220 --> 35:05.340
how can you

35:06.460 --> 35:08.980
make irresponsible remarks about the late Emperor?

35:09.100 --> 35:11.140
You guessed groundlessly, too.

35:11.460 --> 35:12.780
How could you blame me

35:13.700 --> 35:15.060
for doing the same?

35:16.700 --> 35:17.740
That's right, Your Majesty.

35:18.140 --> 35:19.980
General Chu was in poor health

35:20.140 --> 35:21.500
for a long time.

35:21.620 --> 35:23.300
Why did people suddenly say

35:23.420 --> 35:24.620
he was poisoned?

35:25.100 --> 35:26.500
Even in that case,

35:26.700 --> 35:28.100
why did the Xie Family

35:28.500 --> 35:30.060
get involved?

35:30.300 --> 35:32.660
Victory news has just arrived.

35:33.060 --> 35:35.500
Frontier troops are still fighting enemies.

35:35.820 --> 35:36.300
Mr. Deng,

35:36.540 --> 35:37.820
such rumors

35:38.020 --> 35:39.940
will break the soldiers' hearts.

35:40.620 --> 35:43.660
As the saying goes, nothing comes from nothing.

35:43.980 --> 35:47.180
Whether the Xie Family has this secret elixir,

35:47.700 --> 35:48.980
Mr. Xie,

35:49.180 --> 35:51.740
you should know it perfectly.

35:52.340 --> 35:53.420
Your brother Xie Yanlai

35:53.500 --> 35:55.100
lurked by General Chu's side

35:55.100 --> 35:56.300
for five years.

35:57.180 --> 35:58.540
There could be plenty of chances

35:59.020 --> 36:01.020
that he could poison the General.

36:02.500 --> 36:03.460
Stop arguing!

36:04.340 --> 36:05.580
Our enemies have just retreated.

36:05.980 --> 36:06.980
All parts of our state

36:07.380 --> 36:08.660
should unite against them.

36:09.420 --> 36:10.740
I don't want to hear you argue.

36:11.780 --> 36:12.860
I just want to ask

36:13.900 --> 36:15.340
when my sister and my uncle

36:16.020 --> 36:17.180
will come back.

36:17.820 --> 36:18.500
Your Majesty,

36:19.060 --> 36:20.140
the Grand Princess is

36:20.180 --> 36:21.300
in mourning for General Chu.

36:21.980 --> 36:22.980
When the war is over

36:23.340 --> 36:24.260
and the funeral is done,

36:24.780 --> 36:26.020
she will come back.

36:26.820 --> 36:27.660
But...

36:28.500 --> 36:29.660
General Chu is gone.

36:30.100 --> 36:31.540
Let's not dwell

36:32.340 --> 36:34.780
on a lady's mourning for her father.

36:35.500 --> 36:37.100
General Chu is a pillar of our state.

36:37.620 --> 36:39.580
He deserves generous rewards.

36:40.500 --> 36:41.780
Even when he's dead,

36:42.300 --> 36:43.420
to boost morale,

36:43.820 --> 36:45.140
frontier troops who won this battle

36:45.540 --> 36:48.100
should be rewarded.

36:48.700 --> 36:49.380
It makes sense.

36:50.060 --> 36:52.060
General Chu is our backbone.

36:52.380 --> 36:53.900
He deserves a national funeral.

36:54.460 --> 36:55.660
Wise decision, Your Majesty.

36:57.020 --> 36:58.860
Mr. Xie, you really

37:00.060 --> 37:01.700
prioritize the greater good.

37:08.860 --> 37:10.100
How long

37:10.820 --> 37:11.740
do you think

37:12.540 --> 37:13.540
this secret can be kept?

37:14.500 --> 37:16.180
If you're so confident,

37:16.940 --> 37:18.380
why don't you ask my brother

37:19.220 --> 37:20.660
when he comes back?

37:22.860 --> 37:23.460
Oh.

37:24.820 --> 37:26.740
The coffin from the Grand Princess...

37:27.220 --> 37:28.620
You can have it sent to Yunzhong

37:29.060 --> 37:30.100
for General Chu

37:30.660 --> 37:31.820
to express your sorrow.

37:34.700 --> 37:36.540
That's golden-thread nanmu, after all.

37:38.300 --> 37:40.100
You wouldn't be reluctant, would you?

38:05.900 --> 38:07.020
After only a few minutes,

38:07.180 --> 38:08.140
you can't read anymore.

38:09.420 --> 38:11.180
Those dense words

38:12.340 --> 38:13.820
give me a headache.

38:15.020 --> 38:15.900
Father,

38:17.020 --> 38:18.580
shall we talk?

38:20.500 --> 38:21.140
About what?

38:21.660 --> 38:22.620
Tell me more

38:22.660 --> 38:24.220
about my mother.

38:41.820 --> 38:43.740
Father.

38:44.020 --> 38:46.660
Father.

38:53.900 --> 38:54.780
Are you hurt?

39:05.140 --> 39:05.780
Do you like it?

39:07.340 --> 39:08.660
Greetings, Lady General.

39:35.100 --> 39:36.860
I miss you so much.

39:46.060 --> 39:46.660
Zhao,

39:47.580 --> 39:48.380
I know

39:48.460 --> 39:49.860
you don't want to hear me out.

39:50.540 --> 39:51.420
But...

39:52.780 --> 39:54.660
It's unfair to Jiu.

39:59.620 --> 40:00.660
People say

40:00.780 --> 40:02.340
your father is the God of War

40:02.460 --> 40:03.420
who never loses a battle.

40:03.900 --> 40:05.140
As long as Chu Ling is around,

40:05.540 --> 40:07.620
the frontier will always be peaceful.

40:08.780 --> 40:10.500
But he's just an ordinary man.

40:11.100 --> 40:12.620
He got injured,

40:13.020 --> 40:14.660
fell sick, and died.

40:15.780 --> 40:16.660
Three years ago,

40:17.300 --> 40:18.340
in the Battle of the Frontier River,

40:19.020 --> 40:20.740
your father was shot by a poisoned arrow

40:20.900 --> 40:22.020
and nearly lost his life.

40:22.500 --> 40:24.460
At that time,

40:25.020 --> 40:26.980
Jiu took out this pill.

40:28.300 --> 40:30.180
The arrow has the Northern Desert's poison!

40:31.180 --> 40:31.940
Any antidote?

40:32.460 --> 40:33.380
The toxin is inside him.

40:33.940 --> 40:34.980
I'll purge it first.

40:36.500 --> 40:37.220
But General,

40:37.500 --> 40:38.460
you must rest very well

40:38.900 --> 40:40.180
instead of going to war again.

40:40.340 --> 40:40.980
Otherwise,

40:41.380 --> 40:42.900
the remaining toxin will spread all over

40:43.180 --> 40:44.100
and you won't live.

40:44.460 --> 40:45.420
The war is urgent.

40:45.860 --> 40:46.860
It can't do without me.

40:46.900 --> 40:47.700
No, General.

40:47.860 --> 40:48.420
You're too weak

40:48.460 --> 40:49.300
to go to war again.

40:49.700 --> 40:50.980
I would rather die

40:51.500 --> 40:52.900
on the battlefield.

40:53.220 --> 40:54.940
How could I just stay bedridden?

40:54.980 --> 40:55.500
General.

40:56.140 --> 40:56.820
General.

40:57.220 --> 40:58.300
Secret elixir from the Xie Clan.

40:58.540 --> 40:59.660
A pill can revive the dying.

41:00.100 --> 41:01.180
Will you try it?

41:02.220 --> 41:03.100
Where did you

41:03.940 --> 41:04.740
get this pill?

41:05.300 --> 41:06.100
From my brother,

41:06.500 --> 41:07.300
before I left home.

41:07.620 --> 41:08.460
He wouldn't harm me.

41:09.140 --> 41:09.940
General,

41:10.220 --> 41:11.380
let me test it.

41:11.500 --> 41:12.780
There's no time for it.

41:13.140 --> 41:14.820
As long as it works,

41:15.220 --> 41:16.620
I will take it

41:17.020 --> 41:18.260
even if it's poison.

41:18.980 --> 41:20.020
Your father took it

41:20.460 --> 41:22.300
as his last hope.

41:22.540 --> 41:23.980
To save his life,

41:24.500 --> 41:25.500
we had no choice

41:25.580 --> 41:26.740
but to take that risk.

41:27.420 --> 41:28.100
Anyway,

41:28.340 --> 41:30.860
without Jiu's pill,

41:31.220 --> 41:32.980
the General would have died that day.

41:37.540 --> 41:38.980
I, Zhong Changrong,

41:39.500 --> 41:41.620
swear on my life.

41:41.980 --> 41:43.820
When Jiu offered the pill,

41:44.020 --> 41:45.380
he told us his true identity

41:45.540 --> 41:47.500
instead of hiding anything.

41:48.020 --> 41:50.460
The General was almost dying,

41:50.780 --> 41:52.820
and we had to take that risk.

41:53.540 --> 41:54.340
Report!

41:55.700 --> 41:57.100
Xie Yanlai is kneeling in public to beg for forgiveness.

41:57.180 --> 41:58.380
Crowds have surrounded him.

41:58.700 --> 41:59.860
It's utter chaos out there.

42:06.940 --> 42:11.540
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

42:11.820 --> 42:14.300
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

42:14.340 --> 42:18.380
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

42:20.620 --> 42:22.740
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

42:22.820 --> 42:24.780
♪And roars in the blaze♪

42:24.860 --> 42:28.100
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

42:28.260 --> 42:30.500
♪Fate imprisons me♪

42:30.660 --> 42:35.460
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

42:35.460 --> 42:39.660
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

42:39.660 --> 42:43.940
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

42:43.940 --> 42:49.380
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

42:49.380 --> 42:51.340
♪With no fear of the distance♪

42:51.340 --> 42:55.060
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

42:55.060 --> 42:59.500
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

42:59.500 --> 43:04.860
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

43:04.860 --> 43:08.460
♪My new pride♪

43:23.260 --> 43:26.140
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

43:26.140 --> 43:28.660
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

43:28.660 --> 43:31.020
♪Amidst the chaos♪

43:31.020 --> 43:35.300
♪I'll always be with you♪

43:36.740 --> 43:38.860
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

43:38.940 --> 43:40.900
♪And roars in the blaze♪

43:40.980 --> 43:44.220
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

43:44.380 --> 43:46.620
♪Fate imprisons me♪

43:46.780 --> 43:51.580
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

43:51.580 --> 43:55.780
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

43:55.780 --> 44:00.060
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

44:00.060 --> 44:05.500
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

44:05.500 --> 44:07.460
♪With no fear of the distance♪

44:07.460 --> 44:11.180
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

44:11.180 --> 44:15.620
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

44:15.620 --> 44:20.980
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

44:20.980 --> 44:24.580
♪My new pride♪
